OL,3,GNEWSAYoung drivers warned peer pressure
OL,4,Acan be fatal
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people at a driving safety event
OL,7,Frun by emergency services say peer
OL,8,Fpressure can lead to showing off with
OL,9,Fpotentially fatal consequences.
OL,11,FA series of sessions in schools and
OL,12,Fcolleges across the north-east of
OL,13,FEngland to raise awareness of the
OL,14,Fdangers comes after an increase in the
OL,15,Fnumber of people killed or seriously
OL,16,Finjured in road collisions in the
OL,17,Fregion.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
