OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1795156022
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAYoung drivers warned peer pressure
OL,4,Acan be fatal
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers aged 17-24 are more likely to
OL,7,Fbe involved in accidents than other age
OL,8,Fgroups and, at a drop-in event at New
OL,9,FCollege Durham, students were able to
OL,10,Ftest their reaction times on a driving
OL,11,Fsimulator and speak to members of the
OL,12,Femergency services.
OL,14,FPriya, 17, a second year student on the
OL,15,FUniform Services Course, said road
OL,16,Fsafety should be taught in schools as
OL,17,Fthere were "plenty of show offs" and it
OL,18,Fwas useful to "know the dangers to
OL,19,Fsteer away from peer pressure".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
